      "message": "Background:\nI built 22.x GSI targets and noticed HWC2-based LiveDisplay was missing, a regression from 21.\nAfter some logging, I found out that LineageHardwareManager was not able to get LineageHardwareService on its first try...\n```\nW LineageHardwareManager: not connected to LineageHardwareManagerService\nE LineageHardwareManager: Unable to get LineageHardwareService. The service either crashed, was not started, or the interface has been called to early in SystemServer init\n```\n...and doesn\u0027t seem to retry until after boot, which causes a bunch of one-time support checks to fail, incl. LiveDisplay.\nFor now I simply made it try getting again on checkService, which seems to be in time for those checks.",
